<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin=""><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/academy.css"><script defer src="/assets/js/academy.js"></script><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('portfolio-theme');document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t||(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light')}catch(e){}})()</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/portfolio.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/master.css"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio"><meta property="og:image" content="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/assets/images/bakhtawar-portfolio-social-v1.png"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/assets/images/bakhtawar-portfolio-social-v1.png"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio — Bakhtawar Khan. Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global."><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio — Bakhtawar Khan. Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global."><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta property="og:title" content="SEO, AEO &amp; GEO Notes | Mr. Bakhtawar"><meta name="twitter:title" content="SEO, AEO &amp; GEO Notes | Mr. Bakhtawar"><meta property="og:description" content="40 SEO, AEO &amp; GEO Notes and Updates from Mr. Bakhtawar, founder of MBK Global. Explore relevant information, project details and ways to get in touch."><meta name="twitter:description" content="40 SEO, AEO &amp; GEO Notes and Updates from Mr. Bakhtawar, founder of MBK Global. Explore relevant information, project details and ways to get in touch."><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/identity.css"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/portfolio-icon-180.png"><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"></head><body data-page="news.html" class="academy page-directory master-refresh fieldnotes-page"><header class="academy-header" id="top"><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><button class="academy-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="academy-nav">Menu <span>+</span></button><nav id="academy-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href='/about'>About</a><a href='/projects'>Projects</a><a href='/services'>Services</a><a class='header-cta' href='/hire-me'>Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="portfolio-more"><summary>More</summary><div class="portfolio-panel"><section><h2>Professional work</h2><a href='/case-studies'>Case Studies</a><a href='/changelog'>Projects Changelog</a><a href='/delivered-project'>Process</a><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/news'>Notes</a></section><section><h2>Contact &amp; career</h2><a href='/book-a-call'>Book a Call</a><a href='/resume'>Resume / CV</a><a href='/hire-me'>Hire Me</a></section><section><h2>Content &amp; media</h2><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/blog'>Blog &amp; Articles</a><a href='/faq'>FAQs</a></section><section><h2>Personal brand</h2><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Founder Profile</a><a href='/social'>Social Profiles</a><a href='/official-links'>Official Links</a></section></div></details><button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch color theme">◐</button></nav></header>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">directory <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1 class="page-title">The work in progress. <em>Documented.</em></h1><p class="page-intro">Short field notes on learning, interface decisions and project updates. For longer stories about MBK and its projects, visit the journal.</p></section><p class="eyebrow">FIELD NOTES / 04</p><div class="notes-top-link"><span>LONG-FORM ARTICLES, PROJECT STORIES &amp; EXPLAINERS</span><a class='button button-primary' href='/blog'>Open the journal ↗</a></div><label class="note-search-label" for="note-search">Find a field note</label><input id="note-search" type="search" placeholder="Search notes, topics and decisions"><p id="note-count" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="notes-list"><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 001</div><div><p class="note-category">BUILD LOG</p><h2 id="section-1">Building a portfolio that grows with me</h2><p>The portfolio is being shaped as a home for projects, writing, social links and visual work. The goal is to keep the site useful and honest as new work develops.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO UPDATE</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 002</div><div><p class="note-category">LEARNING</p><h2 id="section-2">Learning by making practical tools</h2><p>Building focused tools is a practical way to learn interface design, API integration, responsive layouts and the small details that make a product easier to use.</p></div><time>LEARNING LOG</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 003</div><div><p class="note-category">NEXT UP</p><h2 id="section-3">Exploring AI and automation workflows</h2><p>I’m exploring practical AI applications, automation and API-connected workflows. The aim is to understand where these tools help and where careful testing still matters.</p></div><time>IN PROGRESS</time></article></div><section aria-labelledby="expanded-notes-title" class="notes-expanded"><h2 id="expanded-notes-title">40 SEO, AEO, GEO &amp; Website Quality Notes</h2><p>These notes document the portfolio’s discovery, accessibility and maintenance priorities. They are guidance and configuration notes, not a claim that every external search engine has already processed the site.</p><div class="notes-list"><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0004</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-5">Brand identity</h2><p>Mr. Bakhtawar is the primary public-facing portfolio name, connected to the full name Bakhtawar Khan.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0005</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-6">Founder context</h2><p>The portfolio identifies the public relationship with MBK Global as Founder of MBK Global.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0006</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-7">Sitewide canonical policy</h2><p>Each indexable page should declare its own canonical URL on the active Netlify domain.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0007</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-8">XML sitemap</h2><p>The sitemap is intended to list public, canonical URLs that return useful pages.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0008</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-9">Robots policy</h2><p>Public HTML pages and assets are allowed for search and AI discovery crawlers by the published robots policy.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0009</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-10">AI search discovery</h2><p>An llms.txt file provides concise navigation hints to public pages and projects.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0010</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-11">Structured data</h2><p>Person and WebSite structured data help explain the identity and purpose of the portfolio.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0011</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-12">Organization context</h2><p>MBK Global is referenced as the associated brand, without claiming unverified awards or company facts.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0012</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-13">Homepage image gallery</h2><p>Selected gallery photographs are also featured on the homepage for easier discovery.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0013</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-14">Image alternative text</h2><p>Gallery images use descriptive alt text to improve accessibility and image understanding.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0014</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-15">Image loading</h2><p>Below-the-fold gallery photographs use lazy loading to reduce initial page work.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0015</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-16">Responsive gallery</h2><p>The homepage gallery grid adapts to desktop, tablet and mobile screen widths.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0016</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-17">Open Graph previews</h2><p>Social preview metadata should match each page’s visible title and description.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0017</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-18">Twitter card metadata</h2><p>Social card metadata is included to help create consistent link previews.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0018</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-19">Page-specific titles</h2><p>Each page should retain a descriptive title that reflects its unique topic.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0019</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-20">Page descriptions</h2><p>Descriptions summarize the page for users and search systems; they do not guarantee ranking.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0020</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-21">Internal linking</h2><p>Related pages link readers to profile, services, projects, articles and contact information.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0021</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-22">Project directory</h2><p>The project page serves as a central index of public MBK-related digital projects.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0022</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-23">Services clarity</h2><p>Service pages describe web development, API integration, automation and SEO topics.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0023</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-24">Technical SEO education</h2><p>Educational pages cover canonical URLs, robots directives, sitemaps and structured data.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0024</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-25">API integration</h2><p>Content explains API integration as a practical area of web and application development.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0025</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-26">Automation workflows</h2><p>Automation notes focus on useful workflows and careful testing rather than unsupported claims.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0026</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-27">AI-related work</h2><p>AI-related content is framed around practical digital applications and transparent limitations.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0027</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-28">Local SEO</h2><p>Local SEO content addresses discoverability and accurate business/profile information.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0028</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-29">AEO content</h2><p>Answer Engine Optimization content emphasizes clear answers, useful headings and trustworthy context.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0029</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-30">GEO content</h2><p>Generative Engine Optimization content emphasizes entity clarity, crawlable pages and credible sources.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0030</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-31">Search accessibility</h2><p>Crawler access is configured in robots.txt, while actual crawling remains controlled by each crawler.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0031</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-32">No indexing guarantee</h2><p>Allowing a crawler does not guarantee indexing, rankings, AI citations or model inclusion.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0032</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-33">Public-only information</h2><p>Only content intentionally published on public pages is meant to be discoverable.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0033</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-34">No private-data exposure</h2><p>Robots permissions do not make private or authenticated content safe to publish.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0034</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-35">Google Search Console</h2><p>The sitemap should be submitted to the correct Search Console property after deployment.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0035</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-36">Bing discovery</h2><p>The public sitemap can also be shared with other search engines that support XML sitemaps.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0036</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-37">Link verification</h2><p>Project and social links should be periodically checked for redirects, broken URLs and ownership accuracy.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0037</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-38">Gallery consistency</h2><p>Gallery captions and alt text should accurately describe the image rather than stuff keywords.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0038</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-39">Accessibility improvements</h2><p>Semantic headings, descriptive links and readable contrast remain useful ongoing checks.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0039</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-40">Performance checks</h2><p>Image dimensions and responsive loading should be checked on mobile devices after deployment.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0040</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-41">Content freshness</h2><p>New notes should describe real changes or clearly label ideas that are planned or in progress.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0041</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-42">Trust and accuracy</h2><p>Professional titles, expertise and project outcomes should be stated only when accurate and supportable.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0042</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-43">Contact path</h2><p>Contact and booking links should remain easy to find from key pages.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0043</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-44">Cross-page consistency</h2><p>Public name, founder relationship, domain and project descriptions should remain consistent across pages.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article><article class="note-card"><div class="note-index">NOTE / 0044</div><div><p class="note-category">SEO / AEO / GEO</p><h2 id="section-45">Post-deployment validation</h2><p>After publishing, check live sitemap, robots.txt, canonical tags, image URLs and representative page status codes.</p></div><time>PORTFOLIO NOTES</time></article></div></section><div class="inline-callout"><span>Have a project or idea?</span><a class='text-link' href='/contact'>Send me a message ↗</a></div>
